                    "line": 69,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Tom Joseph",
                        "email": "rushtotom@gmail.com",
                        "username": "tomjoseph83"
                    },
                    "message": "For readability, prefer to organise [in] parameters followed by [out] parameters.\n\n<pldmType, completionCode, data>"
                },
                {
                    "file": "pldmtool/pldm_cmd_helper.hpp",
                    "line": 69,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Rajeev Ranjan",
                        "email": "ranjan.rajeev1609@gmail.com",
                        "username": "rajeeranjan"
                    },
                    "message": "the data should be [in] and not [out] here. Corrected it.\nAlso, the default parameters must be trailing parameters, so pldmType can't be placed before non-default parameters (completionCode, data)"
                }
            ],
